# Generated artifacts
# (fridge/ is tracked for GitHub Actions sync)

# Data Persistence
# SQLite databases must never be committed — PostgreSQL is the source of
# truth. Match any *.db or *.sqlite file under backend/data/ (and any
# other data directory) so local dev artifacts do not leak into Git.
data/database.db
backend/data/*.db
backend/data/*.sqlite
backend/data/*.sqlite3
backend/data/temp_gen.db

# Site Builds (Generated at root)
# /plan.json
# /context.json
# /actuals.json
backend/certs/
certs/
.opencode/
debug_routes.py
.secrets
.vars
.docker/
*.tmp
!AGENTS.md

# Test artifacts
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
coverage/
*.coverage

# Editor / IDE
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
